    "created_at": "2016-10-27T01:04:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-27T01:04:00Z",
    "body": "I don't think we can use `isTrusted` on message events, because it is currently always `true` for all message events invoked via `postMessage`.\n\n`navigator.triggeredByUserActivation` may leak the fact to other origins. A new property on `MessageEvent` might be better to delegate the knowledge of a user action by explicitly sending the message.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
