    "created_at": "2016-10-27T06:19:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-27T06:19:47Z",
    "body": "If we expose it it should be exposed on the global I think since it's a task-annotation effectively. But I'm not sure we have described the underlying concept well enough to expose an API. E.g., integration with a theoretical interaction event specification is missing, `setTimeout()` forwarding is not defined. This new `MessageEvent` forwarding is not defined, etc.\n",
